abstract: >-
  Materials for tutorial T9 at the European Conference on Computational
  Biology 2026. The tutorial introduces computational approaches for
  inferring protein abundance from single-cell and spatial transcriptomic
  data. It covers spatial and multimodal technologies, spatial and
  non-spatial inference methods, evaluation strategies, underlying
  assumptions, and common sources of error. The materials combine
  conceptual instruction with Python and Jupyter notebook exercises.

